read_only_body:
Your MorphoCloud storage (MyDrive) expired on {{kept_until}}. Any instance you had was deleted, and MyDrive is now read-only until {{read_only_until}}: download what you need from the portal with "Open my files". You cannot add or change files, or use an instance.

After {{read_only_until}}, MyDrive is deleted with every file in it, unless a MorphoCloud admin approves more time. To ask, sign in to the portal and press "Ask to keep my storage": {{portal_url}}

If you have questions, contact {{contact_email}}.

deleted_body:
Your MorphoCloud storage (MyDrive) was deleted on {{today}}. It expired on {{kept_until}} and was read-only for {{grace_days}} days.

You can create new, empty storage from the portal at any time: {{portal_url}}

If you have questions, contact {{contact_email}}.

approved_body:
A MorphoCloud admin approved your request. Your storage (MyDrive) now expires on {{kept_until}}.{{note_line}}

{{portal_url}}

If you have questions, contact {{contact_email}}.

declined_body:
A MorphoCloud admin declined your request to extend your storage (MyDrive). It still expires on {{kept_until}}.{{note_line}}{{deletion_line}}

You can ask again from the portal: {{portal_url}}

If you have questions, contact {{contact_email}}.

